<title>USA: San Antonio feeder cattle prices steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>San Antonio feeder cattle prices steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were steady, compared to last week, USDA said.</p>
<p>Bulk of supply Medium and Large 1-2 300-600 lb feeder steers and heifers. Supply included around 20 percent slaughter cows and bulls; 25 percent feeder cattle over 600 lbs with balance mostly feeder cattle under 600 lbs.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 - 600-700 lbs 67.50-78.00, pkg 82.25; 700-750 lbs 65.25-68.50; 800-875 lbs 65.00-69.00. Medium and Large 1-2 - 600-900 lbs 60.00-66.00.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 - 600-700 lbs 65.00-73.00. Medium and Large 1-2 - 500-600 lbs 65.00-68.25; 600-900 lbs 56.00-64.00. Receipts - 1,204  Last Week - 895  Last Year - 1,917</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
